From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ken Russell <kbr@chromium.org>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 19:06:34 -0700
Subject: GL: revise size checks for compressed texture workarounds.

For the previous upload_oversized_mip_levels_via_unpack_buffer
workaround, compute compressed texture sizes in blocks rather than
pixels to be more correct. Add a regression test for oversized ASTC
mipmap uploads which ensures they don't crash.

Bug: chromium:556435507
Change-Id: I760af244cb9eed1fef50021657f7c39f8b5c029e
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/8415754
Reviewed-by: Geoff Lang <geofflang@chromium.org>
Auto-Submit: Kenneth Russell <kbr@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Geoff Lang <geofflang@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Zhenyao Mo <zmo@chromium.org>

